      "text": "CONFUSED-DEPUTY DEFENSE: Bind delegation to tenant + subject + client + audience + tools + asset constraints + expiry.\nNever let the host choose an arbitrary tenant, reuse another app's grant, or pass raw Adobe refresh tokens to the model.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
