      "text": "1. Why control plane?\nLLM intent is non-deterministic; authorization, approvals, quotas, and audit must be deterministic.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e119",
      "originalText": "1. Why control plane?\nLLM intent is non-deterministic; authorization, approvals, quotas, and audit must be deterministic.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
